commit b3c3bca659cf3dccb85c98efad3d121a21d3f6cd
Author: loop-bench <loop-bench@localhost>
Date:   Wed Nov 4 22:35:34 2026 +0100

    feat(orchestrator): sum usage across tool rounds in afterModelResponse

    afterModelResponse now receives the turn's total usage, summed per field
    over every provider call the turn made, instead of the last round's
    usage alone. Rounds that report no usage contribute nothing and a turn
    where none reported still reports undefined. The contract is typed as
    the exported TurnUsage so the sum is visible at the call site.

    Refs: re-cinq/HALEngine#93

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

